OL,3,GNEWSAFirst birth of tiny rare frogs at
OL,4,ALondon Zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FFifteen critically endangered frogs
OL,7,Fhave been born at London Zoo, which
OL,8,Fsays marks the first time the species
OL,9,Fhas been bred in captivity.
OL,11,FThe Afia Birago's puddle frog lives in
OL,12,FGhana's Atewa Hills Forest Reserve,
OL,13,Fwhere the Zoological Society of London
OL,14,F(ZSL) says it survives in just two
OL,15,Fpools that are both under threat from
OL,16,Fmining.
OL,18,FTwenty adults were brought to London in
OL,19,FSeptember 2025 so experts could learn
OL,20,Fhow to care for and breed them, and
OL,21,Fpass that knowledge on to
OL,22,Fconservationists in Ghana.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
